da }_{2}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{D}{{{[\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ {v}_{1} & {v}_{2} \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}}_{⏟}}_{{P}^{-1}}\n$$\n\nLet $P=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}].$ Then,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}^{-1} & ={[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}6 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, carrying out the necessary matrix multiplication, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}E & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5\\end{aligned}](\\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}6 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}9 & -15 \\\\ 12 & -30\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}6 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}19 & -12 \\\\ 32 & -21\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392116 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392117 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392118 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392119 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392120 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186392118 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392115 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f73eb74f-7d8e-56f2-a6c1-4e42926c09f2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392116 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392116 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392116 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7d5f0e3f-05e4-5b32-8e42-33db9fecfeec" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186392117 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 175921860